---
// About.astro — Dark Arcade Theme
---

<section class="section-pad section-alt" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-center">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">[ C:\CONFLUENCE\ABOUT.DOC ]</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">The 24-Hour National Innovation Hackathon</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Student coders across India unleashed creativity, innovated fearlessly, and tested their technical limits — all in 24 non-stop hours.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Main panel -->
      <div class="about-main xp-panel">
        <div class="xp-titlebar">
          <span class="xp-titlebar-title">ABOUT_CONFLUENCE_2025.TXT</span>
          <div class="xp-titlebar-dots">
            <span class="xp-titlebar-dot xp-titlebar-dot--min"></span>
            <span class="xp-titlebar-dot xp-titlebar-dot--max"></span>
            <span class="xp-titlebar-dot xp-titlebar-dot--close"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-body">
          <p class="about-lead">
            <strong class="hl-cyan">Confluence</strong> is the flagship national-level 24-hour hackathon organized by <strong class="hl-cyan">IEEE Computer Society PES University</strong>, in association with the <strong class="hl-yellow">EEE Department at PESU RR Campus</strong> and <strong class="hl-purple">C3I at PESU ECC</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Over 24 sleepless hours, student teams turned conceptual ideas into functional, deployed prototypes addressing real-world AI challenges across 8 curated domains. The hackathon provided a high-octane arena for passionate builders to collaborate, innovate, and ship products under pressure.
          </p>

          <div class="workflow-grid">
            <div class="flow-item fi-blue">
              <span class="flow-num">00</span>
              <strong>Idea Submission</strong>
              <p>Teams submitted problem statements &amp; AI solution proposals in the preliminary round.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-item fi-green">
              <span class="flow-num">01</span>
              <strong>Top 40 Shortlisted</strong>
              <p>Evaluators shortlisted the best 40 teams from nationwide applicants.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-item fi-purple">
              <span class="flow-num">02</span>
              <strong>24-Hour Build Sprint</strong>
              <p>Teams built working software/hardware models with ongoing mentor reviews.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-item fi-pink">
              <span class="flow-num">03</span>
              <strong>Live Pitch &amp; Demo</strong>
              <p>Finalists delivered 10-minute presentations to industry &amp; academic judges.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fact cards -->
      <div class="about-facts">
        <div class="fact-card xp-panel">
          <span class="fact-emoji">📍</span>
          <div>
            <span class="fact-label">VENUE</span>
            <h4 class="fact-val">13th Floor, BE Block</h4>
            <p class="fact-sub">PES University RR Campus, 100 Feet Ring Road, BSK III Stage, Bengaluru 560085</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fact-card xp-panel">
          <span class="fact-emoji">📅</span>
          <div>
            <span class="fact-label">DATES</span>
            <h4 class="fact-val">February 14–15, 2025</h4>
            <p class="fact-sub">24-hour sprint from kickoff to final valedictory ceremony</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fact-card xp-panel">
          <span class="fact-emoji">🏆</span>
          <div>
            <span class="fact-label">PRIZE POOL</span>
            <h4 class="fact-val">₹70,000</h4>
            <p class="fact-sub">Awarded based on innovation, technical execution and viability</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fact-card xp-panel">
          <span class="fact-emoji">👥</span>
          <div>
            <span class="fact-label">TEAM SIZE</span>
            <h4 class="fact-val">3–4 Members</h4>
            <p class="fact-sub">Open to all undergraduate engineering students, all years and branches</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; align-items: start; }
  }

  .about-main { overflow: hidden; }

  .about-body {
    padding: clamp(1.1rem,3vw,1.75rem);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .about-lead { font-size: 1.07rem; color: var(--text-bright); }
  .hl-cyan   { color: var(--neon-cyan); }
  .hl-yellow { color: var(--arcade-yellow); }
  .hl-purple { color: var(--neon-magenta); }

  .workflow-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.85rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(0,212,255,0.25);
  }

  @media (max-width:500px) { .workflow-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .flow-item {
    background: rgba(0,5,30,0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.25);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.8rem;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .flow-item:hover { border-color: rgba(0,212,255,0.6); }

  .fi-blue   { border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-cyan); }
  .fi-green  { border-left: 3px solid var(--pixel-green); }
  .fi-purple { border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-violet); }
  .fi-pink   { border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-pink); }

  .flow-num {
    font-family: var(--font-pixel); font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--neon-cyan); opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .flow-item strong { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-bright); }
  .flow-item p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0; }

  .about-facts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }

  .fact-card {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.95rem; padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
  }

  .fact-card:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), var(--glow-cyan);
  }

  .fact-emoji {
    font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1; flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 6px;
    background: rgba(0,212,255,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.3);
    border-radius: 8px;
    width: 46px; height: 46px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(0,212,255,0.3));
  }

  .fact-label {
    font-family: var(--font-retro); font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--neon-cyan); letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    display: block; margin-bottom: 1px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,212,255,0.4);
  }

  .fact-val {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .fact-sub {
    font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.4; margin: 2px 0 0;
  }
</style>